Niagara N4 Documentation Navigator

positional arguments:
  {class,search,hierarchy,guide,guide-search,devguide,pdf,module,method,source,package,xref,slots,implementors,find,related,devguide-search,stats,source-grep,inherited-slots,examples,method-sig,enum,module-deps,compare,annotations,profile,snippet,callers,overrides,contract,inherited-methods,compatible,graph,api,hotspots,chain,fuzzy,module-summary,export,interface-hierarchy,archetypes,orphans,recipe,checklist,topics,action-params,event-flow,export-html,export-module,coverage,diff-api,build-call-index,freshness,rebuild-all,selftest,repl,versions}
                        Available commands
    class               Look up a class by name (package, inheritance, methods)
    search              Search classes by glob pattern
    hierarchy           Show subclass tree or inheritance chain
    guide               Search guides by topic/folder
    guide-search        Full-text search in guides-clean/ with relevance ranking
    devguide            Search Developer Guide TOC
    pdf                 Search PDFs by name and full-text
    module              Cross-reference summary: classes + guides + PDFs
    method              Search methods/fields/constructors by name
    source              Look up or view Java source code
    package             Browse classes by package
    xref                Show import cross-references
    slots               Search/view @NiagaraProperty, @NiagaraAction, @NiagaraTopic
    implementors        Find classes implementing an interface
    find                Unified full-text search across ALL sources with relevance ranking
    related             Discovery: related classes by package, hierarchy, xref, guides
    devguide-search     Full-text search in devguide-clean/ with relevance ranking
    stats               Corpus overview with counts and sizes
    source-grep         Full-text regex search across ALL source files
    inherited-slots     Alias of 'slots --inherited': show all slots including inherited from
                        parents
    examples            Find usage examples of a class across source files
    method-sig          Search methods by parameter/return type
    enum                Show enum/frozen values and ordinals
    module-deps         Show module dependency graph
    compare             Side-by-side comparison of two classes
    annotations         Search source files for Niagara annotations
    profile             Full class profile: identity, hierarchy, slots, methods, xref
    snippet             Extract a single method's source code
    callers             Find classes that call a specific method
    overrides           Show which methods a class overrides from parents
    contract            Show interface contract: methods + implementors
    inherited-methods   Show all methods including inherited from parents
    compatible          Find converters, points, and extensions for a type
    graph               ASCII dependency graph for a class
    api                 Public API surface (own methods + overrides, no framework noise)
    hotspots            Most referenced/complex classes and most used types
    chain               Multi-hop call chain tracing for a method
    fuzzy               Approximate search across classes, methods, slots, guides
    module-summary      Full module overview: classes, deps, slots, API summary
    export              Export full class report to markdown file
    interface-hierarchy
                        Alias of 'hierarchy --interface': show interface inheritance hierarchy
    archetypes          List Niagara architectural patterns (services, points, etc.)
    orphans             Find classes with zero used_by references
    recipe              Development recipe for a concept (alarm, service, driver, etc.)
    checklist           Implementation checklist for a base class
    topics              Show topics fired by a class and potential subscribers
    action-params       Find actions that accept a given parameter type
    event-flow          Trace event flow for a topic name
    export-html         Alias of 'export --html': export class report as standalone HTML file
    export-module       Alias of 'export --module': export full module report to markdown
    coverage            Documentation coverage report (overview exits 1 on guide folders with
                        unindexed HTML pages)
    diff-api            Compare two API export JSON files
    build-call-index    Build call-index.json (pre-computed method call graph)
    freshness           Check whether indexes are in sync with the raw corpus
    rebuild-all         Rebuild all indexes in dependency order, then stamp the manifest
    selftest            Assert core search behaviours (exits non-zero on failure)
    repl                Interactive mode (keeps indexes in memory)
    versions            Manage Niagara versions: 'versions add <install>' onboards a new install
                        in one command (exit 0 ready, 1 a gate failed, 2 cannot add); 'versions
                        list'

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --niagara-version VERSION
                        Niagara version to query (default from versions/registry.json; env
                        NIAGARA_HELP_VERSION). Accepted anywhere on the command line.

